{"evt":"note_created","id":"note-mqgsot6ywxr","workspace":"D:\\zonoid","title":"VERDICT: dashboard-per-repo attempt APPROVED (hold-merge)","summary":"Adversarial code review of impl attempt orch/attempt/b1c48279-...-1 (daemon.js, routes/meta.js, routes/session.js, public/graph.html, test/workspaces-daemon.test.js). APPROVE — hold-merge (flat task, dispatcher merges; judge did NOT merge).\n\nVERIFIED: (1) GET /workspaces unions workspaces.json registry + state.workspace + session + agent + graphStore.allStores() dirs (cross-platform /.graph strip via both path.sep+'.graph' and '/.graph'), dedupes via Set, returns {ok,current,workspaces:[{path,name,current}]}, NO buildGraph (pure path enumeration — cheap). setWorkspace persists workspaces.json as a best-effort union (read/append-if-absent/write, try-catch like WS_FILE). fs+path are module-level requires in meta.js; WORKSPACES_FILE+graphStore correctly added to ctx destructure and exported from daemon.js.\n\n(2) DASHBOARD COMPLETENESS (highest risk) — CLEARED. Every per-repo fetch routes through dfetch(): /state (x3 incl resilient tick + no-store), /costflow (x3), /task/detail (x3), /guidance, /graph/delta, /search, AND the /guidance/resolve POST (x2). Correctly left raw/global: /workspaces (picker source), /cron/usage (x3), /harness/overhead (x2), /health (HEALTH_URL), /active-claim ping (result discarded), and /events EventSource (change-signal only — onmessage just calls tick() which itself uses dfetch('/state'), so no workspace leak). No per-repo endpoint left on raw fetch.\n\n(3) RESOLVE-WORKSPACE detail — CORRECT. targetOverlay(b,u) = (b&&b.workspace) || u.searchParams.get('workspace') || state.workspace. /guidance/resolve POST calls targetOverlay(b,u); dashboard sends workspace as QUERY param (not body), so with no body.workspace it falls through to the query param. Per-repo resolve targets the right overlay. (Server-side /state, /costflow, /graph/delta, /search, /task/detail, /guidance ALL already honored ?workspace= pre-change — impl correctly only added the client threading + the comment.)\n\n(4) SCOPE — clean. No auth/token redesign; /cron|/health not made per-re","created_by":"main","valid_from":"2026-06-16T15:26:36.490Z","vec":[-0.14496901631355286,0.011596309021115303,-0.05241423100233078,0.01069178618490696,0.030939709395170212,-0.08182066679000854,-0.01997273974120617,0.0526590459048748,0.001035562832839787,0.07323849946260452,0.00860974658280611,-0.030525563284754753,0.010919072665274143,-0.006045160349458456,0.0302592720836401,0.013724487274885178,0.03851393610239029,-0.016055136919021606,-0.03304043039679527,-0.06964222341775894,0.05439009889960289,0.0014563979348167777,0.021970096975564957,-0.047117557376623154,0.007059107068926096,0.021062584593892097,-0.0949043482542038,-0.015645397827029228,-0.045479997992515564,-0.04343871399760246,0.037652160972356796,0.006943187676370144,-0.13110817968845367,-0.01395944319665432,0.03405795618891716,0.12202488631010056,-0.00011793857993325219,-0.03450556844472885,-0.010685931891202927,-0.04160201922059059,0.008257070556282997,0.11936593800783157,-0.08133214712142944,-0.016911502927541733,-0.05080856382846832,-0.05971898138523102,-0.11321566253900528,-0.029738137498497963,-0.013512684963643551,-0.04023095220327377,-0.055393364280462265,-0.018748249858617783,0.024235181510448456,0.014025663956999779,0.07929378747940063,0.07875536382198334,-0.002442100550979376,0.029252050444483757,-0.010458570905029774,-0.0018016219837591052,0.0525595098733902,-0.04484177753329277,-0.035345859825611115,-0.010433292016386986,0.0375557504594326,-0.01568574458360672,0.009354198351502419,-0.0013706620084121823,0.03543638065457344,0.0218795258551836,-0.029715878888964653,0.02875126153230667,-0.07966591417789459,-0.05210074782371521,-0.004327395465224981,0.08459117263555527,0.012852216139435768,0.03237512335181236,-0.07374988496303558,-0.13757635653018951,-0.02828993648290634,0.0001020765193970874,-0.031193729490041733,0.04716850072145462,-0.0258